        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Aye -- the last drop of the Frogmorton harvest cask. The Floating Log's own autumn brew, and the last barrel of it anywhere, now the brewer's gone. Five of them out there, each certain the final drop is theirs by right. Me, I judge it by the old custom of the cask, and the custom this month runs: '<CUSTOM6330>'. Have a word with the claimants if you like -- then tell me, who gets the last drop?"
          }
        }
