        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "There's Marigold Bunce, the brewer's widow; Poppy Thistlewool, who paid coin for the barrel; Hob Broadbelt, who tapped it and drank first; Ned Puddifoot, who carted it here from Frogmorton; and Daisy Goodbody, who won some wager over it at darts. All five underfoot, all five thirsty, and only one drop of ale between them."
          }
        }
      },
