        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Rigrin holds the mug up to the light, weighs the room for a long moment, and pours the last drop exactly where you said* ...Right you are, by the custom! There -- settled, and not a chair thrown. Here's a bit of coin from the pool for the judging, and a pint of my own brewing besides. Mind yourself -- it's got a kick to it."
