        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Rigrin sucks his teeth* No... no, that's not where the custom points this month, and now the whole room knows it. *the arguing redoubles behind you* Ah well -- the drop keeps another day, but you've had your judging. Come back tomorrow: the custom turns with the month, and the argument never stops."
